{"4210550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pigmen's Challenge", "steam_appid": 4210550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4945870], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Piggies. One restaurant. Endless chaos.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/d8633c103a67b7de6aa03a4848ed7491.poster.avif?t=1785167740\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/d8633c103a67b7de6aa03a4848ed7491.webm?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/d8633c103a67b7de6aa03a4848ed7491.mp4?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigmen’s Challenge is a fast-paced 2–player co-op cooking game where teamwork is everything.<br>Each day, you and your partner swap roles — one Piggie cooks in the kitchen, the other serves customers out front.<br>The next day? Roles reverse. New tasks, new pressure, new panic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/94761bdc065ea82b337ea7b70f6eba4c.poster.avif?t=1785167740\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/94761bdc065ea82b337ea7b70f6eba4c.webm?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/94761bdc065ea82b337ea7b70f6eba4c.mp4?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal sounds simple:<br><strong>Survive the day and move to the next.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the kitchen, communicate clearly, and keep your customers  happy.<br>Expect chaos, repeat attempts, rising difficulty, and pure co-op fun!<br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/091934204a5c09c23a5ca8b1b83e5504.poster.avif?t=1785167740\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/091934204a5c09c23a5ca8b1b83e5504.webm?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/091934204a5c09c23a5ca8b1b83e5504.mp4?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2–Player Co-Op:</strong> Designed entirely for teamwork and communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Role Swapping:</strong> One day you cook, the next you serve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Reset on Fail:</strong> Mess up a single day and start from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising Difficulty:</strong> Each day becomes harder, and more chaotic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/988627bf3e2c866ef2bb6927e2eb0b97.poster.avif?t=1785167740\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/988627bf3e2c866ef2bb6927e2eb0b97.webm?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/988627bf3e2c866ef2bb6927e2eb0b97.mp4?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Piggies. One restaurant. Endless chaos.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/d8633c103a67b7de6aa03a4848ed7491.poster.avif?t=1785167740\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/d8633c103a67b7de6aa03a4848ed7491.webm?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/d8633c103a67b7de6aa03a4848ed7491.mp4?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigmen’s Challenge is a fast-paced 2–player co-op cooking game where teamwork is everything.<br>Each day, you and your partner swap roles — one Piggie cooks in the kitchen, the other serves customers out front.<br>The next day? Roles reverse. New tasks, new pressure, new panic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/94761bdc065ea82b337ea7b70f6eba4c.poster.avif?t=1785167740\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/94761bdc065ea82b337ea7b70f6eba4c.webm?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/94761bdc065ea82b337ea7b70f6eba4c.mp4?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal sounds simple:<br><strong>Survive the day and move to the next.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the kitchen, communicate clearly, and keep your customers  happy.<br>Expect chaos, repeat attempts, rising difficulty, and pure co-op fun!<br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/091934204a5c09c23a5ca8b1b83e5504.poster.avif?t=1785167740\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/091934204a5c09c23a5ca8b1b83e5504.webm?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/091934204a5c09c23a5ca8b1b83e5504.mp4?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2–Player Co-Op:</strong> Designed entirely for teamwork and communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Role Swapping:</strong> One day you cook, the next you serve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Reset on Fail:</strong> Mess up a single day and start from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising Difficulty:</strong> Each day becomes harder, and more chaotic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/988627bf3e2c866ef2bb6927e2eb0b97.poster.avif?t=1785167740\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/988627bf3e2c866ef2bb6927e2eb0b97.webm?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210550/extras/988627bf3e2c866ef2bb6927e2eb0b97.mp4?t=1785167740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Pigmen’s Challenge is a 2-player co-op cooking game where one player cooks and the other serves, with roles swapping each day. Keep customers happy, survive the chaos, and see if your teamwork can handle the rising difficulty.", "supported_la